cache validation
provenance
reproducibility

43. CANONICAL SERIALIZATION
Geometric objects must have deterministic serialization.
Equivalent geometry must serialize identically after normalization.
Normalization may include:
vertex ordering
floating-point precision
orientation normalization
parameter ordering

44. GEOMETRY CACHE
Repeated geometry computation should use caching.
Cache key:
project_id
model_version_id
object_id
geometry_version
